Dataset License — CC BY 4.0
===========================

The structured card dataset in this directory (the JSON files under
`cards/` and `card_overrides.json`) is a compilation by the maintainer of
Cartão Ideal and is licensed under the Creative Commons Attribution 4.0
International license (CC BY 4.0).

Full license text: https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/legalcode
Human-readable summary: https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/

You are free to share and adapt this dataset for any purpose, including
commercially, provided you give appropriate credit. Suggested attribution:

    "Cartão Ideal — github.com/caiotheodoro/cartaoideal"

EXCLUSIONS — this license does NOT cover:

1. Card artwork under `platform/public/card-images/`. Card art is the
   property of the respective issuers and is used nominatively to identify
   the products; each file's origin is recorded in `media.art_provenance`.
2. Trademarks, product names and logos of card issuers and networks, which
   belong to their respective owners. Their appearance in the data is
   nominative and implies no affiliation or endorsement.
3. The application source code of this repository, which is licensed
   separately under the MIT license (see the root LICENSE file).

The facts compiled here (fees, benefits, eligibility rules) were gathered
from public sources cited per card in the `provenance` and `source_url`
fields. See README.md in this directory for the full provenance statement.
